I was a chaotic Barbarian.  Doing pretty darn well, too, having been
sacrificing up a storm(bringer).  :-)  Anyway, killed a wererat and
scrificed the human corpse, which is supposed to be a good thing for
Chaotics (and BAD for others).  A peaceful demon appeared in response 
to the sacrifice and just hung around, doing me no good at all.  He did
follow me and my pets down a level, but that was it.  In desperation to
find some use for him, and thinking that this might make him "tame",
I tossed him a tripe ration.  He wasn't pleased about that, attacking 
and swallowing me.  I managed to kill him and get out, but he had 
poisoned me while inside and I died shortly afterwards.

Anyway, what CAN a chaotic character do with a peaceful demon?  One 
interesting thing was that the pets didn't attack him.

-Ron


